=== Futeroa Content Press ===
Contributors: futeroa.com
Tags: futeroa, content, press
Requires at least: 3.0.0
Tested up to: 3.3.3
Stable tag: 3.0.0

The Futeroa Wordpress Plugin sends your last published article to Futeroa and converts it into a high quality promotion page automatically.

== Description ==

Futeroa Content Press is a Wordpress Plugin that sends your articles to the Futeroa Promotion Pages automatically.
This Promotion Page gives you a content link (backlink) to build more value for your blog and thus better positioned within search engines.

== Upgrade Notice ==
You will receive an email when there is an update available

