== Installation ==

1. go to `Installed Plugins`, then click on `Add new` and Search for Futeroa.

2. Select Futeroa Content Press and click on `Install now` and Activate

You are done and your last article has been sent automaticly.
 
After Installation You can change some settings.
Look for Futeroa Press under the menu `Settings`

== Screenshots ==

We made a very simple instruction on http://wpplugin.futeroa.com.

== Frequently Asked Questions ==

What is the benefit of this plugin?

- Your content on the Futeroa Promotion Page will have a backlink to your blog.

- Your blog will be better positioned within search engines and you create more visitors to your website.

When will my article be sent?

- As soon as you or somenone visits your website.

- Often you will check your post yourself, so in this case immediatly.

How many articles can I sent?

- Unlimited

How will I know when my article is posted on Futeroa?

- if your admin emailaddress is filled you receive a notification e-mail.

How can I stop receiving notification emails?

- You can stop receiving our emails and turn it on again.

- Look for `Futeroa Press` under the menu `Settings`

Where can I see my article?

- We will put the link to your article in the confirmation email

- If you have selected a category it will be visible at http://{category}.futeroa.com

- If you have selected --your category-- it will be visible at http://{your category}.futeroa.com 

- If we don't have your category it will be visible at http://news.futeroa.com or http://nieuws.futeroa.com (for Dutch)

I have another language

- At this moment there's only English and Dutch.

- Please select your language in our settings

- Look for `Futeroa Press` under the menu `Settings`

